        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Off-white vest with pink trim.  Circle patches in floral fabrics applied to front and back.  \n\nPink silk shirt with long sleeves, elasticized cuffs.  Open neckline with thin strings attached to tie at top.  White floral ribbon trim creates two vertical lines down top front and wraps around the waist.  \n\nOff-white skirt with wide waistband and circle patches in floral fabrics."@en ;
